    {
      "key": "hello",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Hai! Aku Atlas, teman kerjamu di ATW Source. Mau kita mulai dari mana?",
      "file": "id-hello.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 53424,
      "sha256": "e9c8b6ddb94bc64952214356f2db17b8dfbd96863e7c292fff915b171695a262"
    },
    {
      "key": "ready",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Siap menemani! Ada yang mau kita kerjakan bareng?",
      "file": "id-ready.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 31536,
      "sha256": "5961107afa27f544237238aead93adf35a2fe82fc311936500c5c1dd9a442bb4"
    },
    {
      "key": "question",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Boleh! Tulis saja pertanyaanmu di sini. Aku bantu, ya.",
      "file": "id-question.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 44640,
      "sha256": "0061c72ffdf51461d884e2784f3bf1af061ab18105132463b5be3b49f8f64a2a"
    },
    {
      "key": "choose",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Kita mulai dari sini, ya. Kamu dari tim ATW Group, atau vendor?",
      "file": "id-choose.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 43056,
      "sha256": "4675ff4c6324aed65927f4621b1d56d2b3ac85726362cbd499807776515917d2"
    },
    {
      "key": "employee",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Halo, tim ATW! Aku bisa bantu pandu permintaan, kode item, harga, dan anggaran. Mau yang mana dulu?",
      "file": "id-employee.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 73296,
      "sha256": "0d8d6e1051ab900c1cf45f2d75b16d84566b65c52bb2142d9f10d0516a4302d4"
    },
    {
      "key": "vendor",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Halo! Aku bisa bantu pendaftaran, penawaran, dokumen, dan progres pesanan. Kita mulai dari mana?",
      "file": "id-vendor.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 65952,
      "sha256": "58a0aac0328d4ed1ccde7dc30a768bbee356552f4f242953ebfacef9fd0f6dd3"
    },
    {
      "key": "registration",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Yuk, siapkan pendaftarannya. Pilih profil usaha dulu, lalu lengkapi dokumen yang sesuai.",
      "file": "id-registration.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 51552,
      "sha256": "425c62dc8f4beb4434b225859a35929f8d6ef64c0078fa7c11c1002cd694ef34"
    },
    {
      "key": "login",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Pakai email yang sudah terdaftar untuk masuk, ya. Nanti aku bantu langkah berikutnya.",
      "file": "id-login.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 47808,
      "sha256": "ca968aced85cf61bfa320e4a4a272d01d7a50fce5627721ae0fa11194247083a"
    },
    {
      "key": "ticket",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Yuk, siapkan permintaannya. Pilih kategori, lengkapi kolom wajib, lalu periksa sebelum dikirim.",
      "file": "id-ticket.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 57024,
      "sha256": "e683d42dedb486d72e343b4ccdff3f6e9fbea5aada67f8cd27ee80e180363dda"
    },
    {
      "key": "itemcode",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Cek katalog item dulu, ya. Kalau kodenya belum ada, aku bantu pandu permintaan kode baru.",
      "file": "id-itemcode.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 52848,
      "sha256": "29a636a630f9b774ba433f34ed1c61f358dc99d0adf595a8dca9afbbd9b680d6"
    },
    {
      "key": "prices",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Kita cek riwayat harga dulu, yuk. Biar ada acuan sebelum lanjut.",
      "file": "id-prices.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 38592,
      "sha256": "28330564e8948e4b9fd3425178cb7123288f2c688033b48c91f389c8d4409ffe"
    },
    {
      "key": "budget",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Yuk, susun anggarannya bareng. Pilih kebutuhan, periksa daftar pekerjaan, lalu cocokkan jumlah dan harganya.",
      "file": "id-budget.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 61776,
      "sha256": "c4a5af97892307f13c18fd606a807a0e32683a5619466afb4b0053b87914d0a4"
    },
    {
      "key": "division",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Kita lihat tindak lanjut divisinya, yuk. Pilih yang paling perlu dikerjakan dulu.",
      "file": "id-division.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 43056,
      "sha256": "a3806b8a242d5bd883e32bccdedf26e33c3d9f74d63e6300071d562d937a376d"
    },
    {
      "key": "quote",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Buka undangan RFQ untuk perusahaanmu, ya. Cek lingkup, harga, dan dokumen sebelum mengirim penawaran.",
      "file": "id-quote.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 61632,
      "sha256": "261556cf236b1a328e0c8061026cd2dd3a0a0bf1922dfabda5f4f6c4cc88451e"
    },
    {
      "key": "invoice",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Yuk, cocokkan invoice dan dokumen pendukungnya dengan pesanan terkait.",
      "file": "id-invoice.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 34128,
      "sha256": "040507031cc56c197d090d78a19a414a7581b4ea41415f20f8971161d3216d81"
    },
    {
      "key": "tracking",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Pakai nomor permintaan atau pesanan yang tercatat, ya. Kita lihat progres dan langkah berikutnya.",
      "file": "id-tracking.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 50832,
      "sha256": "45c37cab3a76a69402bf3fbcdb67d5abcd5ff278e72e8febdad3bacbd1fd600e"
    },
    {
      "key": "approval",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Aku bantu cek langkah berikutnya, ya. Keputusan persetujuan tetap dari pejabat yang berwenang di ATW Source.",
      "file": "id-approval.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 56016,
      "sha256": "38286a9cbbd469be510d3a5d579daece74d7547080ef758aee71097cd18e44c6"
    },
    {
      "key": "wbs",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Untuk laporan rahasia, gunakan formulir pelaporan, ya. Simpan nomor referensi dan kode aksesnya baik-baik.",
      "file": "id-wbs.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 59904,
      "sha256": "c10ad10368288f12b4c197c99d4818fe4983cf801982b7d5a587062f243aee38"
    },
    {
      "key": "summaryPending",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Ringkasannya sudah siap. Ada tindak lanjut yang perlu dicek. Mau kita buka yang pertama?",
      "file": "id-summaryPending.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 50112,
      "sha256": "eb0035e38b3c25cccbe805a5e0801267b8fb8e1d497f1a1f8a5975bcffe04b9a"
    },
    {
      "key": "summaryClear",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Tidak ada tindak lanjut tertunda di halaman ini. Mau lanjut ke pekerjaan yang mana?",
      "file": "id-summaryClear.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 43344,
      "sha256": "96b527c9eaa564d2d7c77a547ff76aefc99cdca54f5048e1aec1b4aa510d6056"
    },
    {
      "key": "budgetMissing",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Struktur anggarannya sudah siap. Masih ada harga yang perlu dilengkapi. Kita cek satu per satu, yuk.",
      "file": "id-budgetMissing.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 57744,
      "sha256": "ebb1ada38d410beb647ea95ef2aad15b4ec611b98de2fb25aefd005f8f0f977e"
    },
    {
      "key": "budgetReady",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Ulasan anggarannya sudah siap. Yuk, lihat waktu pengadaan, prioritas, dan potensi hambatannya.",
      "file": "id-budgetReady.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 57744,
      "sha256": "6d079880919713fe56b588019559336aabae1733edbf6f809c75a90f363d02f2"
    },
    {
      "key": "documentIssues",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Hasil cek dokumennya sudah siap. Ada beberapa hal yang perlu diperiksa. Mau kita lihat temuannya?",
      "file": "id-documentIssues.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 54576,
      "sha256": "02cc63f92a674371962d5ecee4e552c6c96f7fceeb64d60f81775c0b75efd777"
    },
    {
      "key": "documentReady",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Ringkasan dokumennya sudah siap. Yuk, cocokkan dengan persyaratan yang terkait.",
      "file": "id-documentReady.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 41472,
      "sha256": "06383bf6ca949a820250d75f3adecba1d854b4264b34fb7737259c6c03ba1f07"
    },
    {
      "key": "reply",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Jawabannya sudah aku siapkan di sini. Coba dilihat, lalu pilih mau lanjut ke mana.",
      "file": "id-reply.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 47088,
      "sha256": "86fe8dfa7574d7566602bc42df31fccd84468e7ccd6122637ab556e433d75ebc"
    },
    {
      "key": "error",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Sebentar, ya. Ada yang perlu dibetulkan dulu sebelum kita lanjut.",
      "file": "id-error.mp3",
      "voice": "id-ID-GadisNeural",
      "bytes": 39888,
      "sha256": "ec7b05b5294e0aceafcde83c4c6fd4caded00a70b16cd728182cc7477029e7b7"
    },
    {
      "key": "taskDone",
      "language": "id",
      "text": "Langkah ini sudah selesai! Selanjutnya mau kita cek apa?",
